    "body": "The editor now imports all 14 vanilla per-drink values and stores sparse 0-1 overrides; runtime integration replaces Rockstar's per-swig result with the configured total and uses the real alcohol global/blackout path. Static checks and the ASI build pass. Because RDR2 is running, the hash-verified install is queued for game exit; this remains actionable until it lands, then it will move to test me.",
